@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title Figure 8 (v1). Item use and wave dispersal sequence
caption Version 1 · 30 October 2026 · superseded by version 2 (12 November 2026). Redrawn from the original PlantUML; content unchanged.
actor User
participant Game
participant Player
participant Item
participant Goose
participant Score
User -> Game : uses an item
Game -> Player : useItem(inventorySlot)
Player -> Item : applyToGeese(geese)
Item -> Goose : disperseGoose()
Goose --> Item
Item --> Player
Player --> Game
Game -> Score : incrementItemsUsed()
alt Wave dispersed
  Game -> Score : addDispersalPoints(geeseCount, timeElapsed)
  Score -> Score : calculateTimeBonus(timeElapsed)
  Game -> Score : applyItemBonus(item)
end
Game -> Score : isAllDispersed()
Score --> Game : result
alt All waves dispersed
  Game -> Game : endGame()
else More waves remaining
  Game -> Game : getNextWave()
end
@enduml
